  "macro:manufacturing":["制造业增加值占 GDP","Manufacturing value added / GDP","制造业增加值占 GDP 的比例。制造业是工业的子集，不能与工业占比相加。","Manufacturing value added relative to GDP. Manufacturing is a subset of industry, so the two shares must not be added.","制造业增加值占 GDP = 制造业增加值 ÷ GDP × 100%","Manufacturing / GDP = manufacturing value added ÷ GDP × 100%",{"zh":"世界银行 WDI","en":"World Bank WDI","code":"NV.IND.MANF.ZS","url":"https://data.worldbank.org/indicator/NV.IND.MANF.ZS"}],
